      "id": "claim_8a451ea40e7f40eebaba90c82b072591",
      "statement": "ADR-0031 retired the object.__setattr__ registration bypass for frozen arms — which hid the arm from the module tree, broke Lightning's automatic .to(device) and forced manual on_fit_start moves — in favour of registration plus explicit dual-exclusion; neither the bypass nor a hand-rolled per-host state-dict override may be reintroduced.",
